<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/22a5144ee8d83bca-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/favicon.png"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/30f0b47aca91e5eb.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/093fd830753a06af.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-43c0f1e99de8566f.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3cd23d45-025847fb999009e7.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/7182-270ff7818af97afc.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-74cd7ddd72c9ffe7.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4598-947ef9a1c187c669.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/zh/layout-7774462612f7ae0d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/zh/%5Bslug%5D/error-d7827ed046b3b2d5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/8924-26f558a2f8b4bba9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4863-6793bdadc5cf1561.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/8615-f8b0d61dbf5d268c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/5462-3807674a427e7de0.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/zh/%5Bslug%5D/page-3b94d7f375b49196.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-SEKQT6DTT1" as="script"/><title>星露谷房屋升级：第二档是65,000金和100硬木</title><meta name="description" content="第一次农舍升级是10,000金和450木材，第二次是65,000金和100硬木，第三次是100,000金。1.6里，第二次的费用换成现在的数额，不再是50,000金和150硬木。每次升级要三天。第二次升级之后，装修是另一笔订单，而且马上完成。"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/zh/house-upgrade-stardew"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/house-upgrade-stardew"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="zh-CN" href="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/zh/house-upgrade-stardew"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/house-upgrade-stardew"/><meta property="og:title" content="星露谷房屋升级：第二档是65,000金和100硬木"/><meta property="og:description" content="第一次农舍升级是10,000金和450木材，第二次是65,000金和100硬木，第三次是100,000金。1.6里，第二次的费用换成现在的数额，不再是50,000金和150硬木。每次升级要三天。第二次升级之后，装修是另一笔订单，而且马上完成。"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/zh/house-upgrade-stardew"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/blog/house-upgrade-stardew-cover-zh.webp"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="星露谷房屋升级：第二档是65,000金和100硬木"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="第一次农舍升级是10,000金和450木材，第二次是65,000金和100硬木，第三次是100,000金。1.6里，第二次的费用换成现在的数额，不再是50,000金和150硬木。每次升级要三天。第二次升级之后，装修是另一笔订单，而且马上完成。"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/blog/house-upgrade-stardew-cover-zh.webp"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__variable_8eaea4"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div data-public-page-shell="true"><header data-public-page-header="true"><nav aria-label="星露谷物语农场规划器"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/90 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold shadow-sm backdrop-blur-lg" data-public-page-brand="true" href="/zh"><img alt="" class="size-7 rounded-md" height="28" src="/favicon.png" width="28"/><span>星露谷物语农场规划器</span></a><div class="flex items-center justify-center" data-slot="dock"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/90 p-2 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-lg transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-xl"><div data-public-page-navigation-links="true"><a aria-label="博客" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-secondary transition-colors" data-slot="dock-icon-button" href="/zh/blog" tabindex="0"><span>博客</span></a></div><div data-public-page-header-actions="true"><div class="contents"><div data-homepage-language-switcher="true"><button aria-controls="_R_39av5tivb_" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="语言" data-homepage-language-trigger="true" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-secondary transition-colors" data-slot="dock-icon-button" type="button" tabindex="0"><span>语言</span><span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button><ul data-homepage-language-menu="true" hidden="" id="_R_39av5tivb_"><li><a data-homepage-language-option="true" href="/house-upgrade-stardew">English</a></li><li><a data-homepage-language-option="true" href="/zh/house-upgrade-stardew">中文</a></li></ul></div></div><a data-public-page-header-action="true" aria-label="打开规划器" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-secondary transition-colors" data-slot="dock-icon-button" href="/zh#planner" tabindex="0"><span>打开规划器</span></a></div></div></div></nav></header><main><article data-blog-article="true"><header><p>星露谷物语指南</p><h1>星露谷房屋升级：第二档是65,000金和100硬木</h1><p class="blog-article-description">第一次农舍升级是10,000金和450木材，第二次是65,000金和100硬木，第三次是100,000金。1.6里，第二次的费用换成现在的数额，不再是50,000金和150硬木。每次升级要三天。第二次升级之后，装修是另一笔订单，而且马上完成。</p><p>作者：<!-- --> <!-- -->星露谷规划器团队<!-- --> · <!-- -->阅读约 6 分钟</p><picture class="public-picture" data-public-picture="true"><source srcSet="/blog/house-upgrade-stardew-cover-zh.avif" type="image/avif"/><img alt="三档付款：升级1是10,000金、450木材和3天；升级2是65,000金、100硬木和3天；升级3是100,000金和3天。" height="941" width="1672" src="/blog/house-upgrade-stardew-cover-zh.webp"/></picture></header><div class="blog-article-layout"><div id="blog-article-house-upgrade-stardew"><article><p>罗宾对第一次农舍升级收取10,000金和450木材，第二次收取65,000金和100硬木，第三次收取100,000金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。第二笔费用是1.6的价格（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Version_History">版本历史</a>）。每次升级都要三天（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。到木匠的商店找罗宾下单。</p><h2>每一档升级要花多少</h2><div aria-label="每一档升级要花多少" class="blog-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="blog-data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">升级</th><th scope="col">金币</th><th scope="col">材料</th><th scope="col">天数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>10,000金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）</td><td>450木材（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）</td><td>3（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>65,000金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）</td><td>100硬木（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）</td><td>3（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>100,000金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）</td><td></td><td>3（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>在1.6中，第二次房屋升级从50,000金和150硬木改为65,000金和100硬木（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Version_History">版本历史</a>）。</p><h2>准备木材和硬木</h2><p>你一开始有一把能砍倒完全长成的树的斧头，后续斧头等级在铁匠铺升级（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Axes">斧头</a>）。砍树取得木材，或者从罗宾的普通存货购买木材（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Wood">木材</a>）。</p><p>硬木是另一种物品（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Hardwood">硬木</a>）。大树桩（Large Stump）是枯死已久的树留下的残骸。铜斧头（Copper Axe）或更好的斧头能清除大树桩，并得到2硬木（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Stump">大树桩</a>）。它不是你砍活树取木材后留下的那个树桩（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Wood">木材</a>）。铜斧头是2,000金和5个铜锭（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Axes">斧头</a>）。钢斧头（Steel Axe）能清除大圆木（Large Log）。钢斧头是5,000金和5个铁锭，也是清除秘密森林入口那根圆木的斧头（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Axes">斧头</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Log">大圆木</a>）。</p><p>那根圆木清除后，秘密森林从煤矿森林（Cindersap Forest）的西北角打开（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Secret_Woods">秘密森林</a>）。这根圆木本身只出一次8硬木，而且不会再长出来（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Log">大圆木</a>）。里面六棵大树桩每天重新长出，一天一共12硬木。四棵在林子的上半部分。另外两棵在更小的下半区域，要从两条被树盖住的通道之一走进去。一条通道从上方三棵树桩东南方的树丛中直穿过去。另一条从入口南边开始，大约在一丛灌木右侧2-3格，先向南，再向西，再向南（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Secret_Woods">秘密森林</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Stump">大树桩</a>）。</p><p>如果只靠这些树桩凑100硬木，从0开始，入口圆木已经清除，不算护林人（Forester）多给的那一块，也不算其他硬木来源或消耗。八次收获、每次12块，是96，离100还差4。这4块是2棵树桩，所以第100块出现在第9次收获（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Secret_Woods">秘密森林</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Stump">大树桩</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Large_Log">大圆木</a>）。这个数字是收获次数，不是日历上的日期。钢斧头是这条秘密森林路线的进门工具。第二次升级仍然按那一行的金币和硬木支付，并不是每种拿到这些硬木的办法都需要这把斧头。</p><h2>先给还缺的木材计价，再累加到某一档</h2><h3>手头已经有200木材</h3><p>第一年做第一次升级、而且450木材里已经有200在手上时，用这笔账。这200是你已经有的木材，不是罗宾另外留下的一堆。这次升级是10,000金和450木材，罗宾第一年的木材是10金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。450 − 200 = 250。把这200木材带上，当趟再买另外250。250 × 10金 = 2,500金。加上10,000金的费用，你要带12,500金。这12,500金只包括费用和这次买的木材。</p><p>第一年，450 × 10金 = 4,500金，这是木材的价钱；4,500金加上10,000金的费用是14,500金。手头已有的这200，就是把14,500金这个总数改成12,500金的原因。第二年及以后，木材是50金。450 × 50金 = 22,500金，这是木材的价钱；22,500金加上同样的10,000金费用是32,500金（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。12,500金这笔账不用50金这个单价。</p><p>罗宾的普通存货出售木材，不出售硬木（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。</p><h3>从初始农舍累加到你点名的那一档</h3><p>这三个总数都从初始农舍算起，把各行加到你点名的那一档为止。它们都不是单独一笔订单的金币（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。</p><p>到升级1，各行加起来是10,000金和450木材。到升级2，10,000金 + 65,000金 = 75,000金，另有450木材和100硬木。到升级3，10,000金 + 65,000金 + 100,000金 = 175,000金，另有450木材和100硬木。这些总数只加农舍升级的各行。还要另买的木材，以及铜斧头或钢斧头，都是另外的花费。按费用表交出单独一笔订单的金币。不要在一次到店时支付75,000金或175,000金。</p><h2>厨房、育儿室和地窖是做什么的</h2><p>第一次升级在房子里加上厨房。在灶台上烹饪。冰箱有36格，可以当箱子用。一份食谱可以用你物品栏里的食材、那台冰箱里的食材，或一台迷你冰箱（Mini-Fridge）里的食材（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Cooking">烹饪</a>）。在厨房水槽给喷壶加水（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。同一次升级加上卧室，并把床从单人床换成双人床（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。</p><p>第二次升级把厨房和卧室加大。新加的房间里，一间是空的。另一间有一张婴儿床和两张儿童床，你可以有两个孩子（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。房间图上的「育儿室」标的就是这间有婴儿床的房间。</p><figure class="blog-article-media"><picture class="public-picture" data-public-picture="true"><source srcSet="/blog/illustrations/house-upgrade-stardew/tier-rooms.zh.avif" type="image/avif"/><img alt="三档标注：升级1是厨房和卧室，升级2是空房间和育儿室，升级3是地窖和外观相同，共用一行写着9×5室外。" decoding="async" height="941" loading="lazy" width="1672" src="/blog/illustrations/house-upgrade-stardew/tier-rooms.zh.webp"/></picture><figcaption>示意图：升级1标着厨房和卧室。升级2标着空房间和育儿室。升级3标着地窖和外观相同。共用一行写着9×5室外。</figcaption></figure><p>第三次升级在房子下面加上地窖。从厨房进去。地窖一开始有33个木桶（Cask，用来陈酿；不是小桶 Keg）。这些木桶陈酿奶酪和果酒，也陈酿山羊奶酪、啤酒、蜜蜂酒和淡啤酒，陈酿会提高它们的品质和价值。这次升级给出的木桶配方是20木材和1硬木。木桶可以放在别的地方，但只有放在地窖里才会收物品。房子外面和上一次升级时一样（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Cask">木桶</a>）。</p><p>室外占地保持9×5，所以房子旁边的地块还是原来那样（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。</p><h2>在山路24号下升级订单</h2><p>罗宾在木匠的商店，山路24号。她出售木材、石头和家具。她升级农舍，也建造农场建筑（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。柜台开着的时候过去，请她升级农舍，并支付下一档的金币和材料。</p><p>普通的一周里，柜台从上午9:00开到下午5:00。周二不营业。周五下午4:00关门。房子每天从上午9:00到晚上8:00都能进去，商店关着也能进。走进房子并不会下单（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。</p><p>下雨、节日、夏季18日去诊所，以及她走过柜台的那些时候，看<a href="https://stardewvalleyplanner.art/carpenter-stardew">罗宾的商店和室外建筑</a>。</p><h2>装修不是下一次升级</h2><figure class="blog-article-media"><picture class="public-picture" data-public-picture="true"><source srcSet="/blog/illustrations/house-upgrade-stardew/upgrade-or-renovation.zh.avif" type="image/avif"/><img alt="两条路径和两个例子：升级写着3天；装修写着升级2之后、即时和退还金币；移除婴儿床写着免费；餐厅写着150,000金。" decoding="async" height="941" loading="lazy" width="1672" src="/blog/illustrations/house-upgrade-stardew/upgrade-or-renovation.zh.webp"/></picture><figcaption>示意图：升级那一路写着升级和3天。装修那一路写着装修、升级2之后、即时和退还金币。移除婴儿床写着免费。餐厅写着150,000金。</figcaption></figure><p>第二次农舍升级之后，罗宾提供房屋装修。你下一单，马上完成。要撤销，先把新区域清空。然后罗宾退还金币，退款立刻到账（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>、<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse">农舍</a>）。</p><p>移除婴儿床免费，而且马上完成（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。餐厅要150,000金，增加一间占地9×10再加4×5的房间，而且马上完成。要把这150,000金拿回来，那片9×10再加4×5的区域必须是空的（<a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop">木匠的商店</a>）。</p><p>想要地窖，就选第三次升级那一行。想要这些改动，就选移除婴儿床或餐厅。</p><section aria-labelledby="blog-planner-cta-heading" class="blog-planner-cta" data-blog-planner-cta="true"><div class="blog-planner-cta__content"><div class="blog-planner-cta__copy"><p class="blog-planner-cta__heading" id="blog-planner-cta-heading"><span class="blog-planner-cta__heading-line">星露谷物语<em>规划器</em></span><span class="blog-planner-cta__heading-line">免费在线农场布局工具</span></p><p class="blog-planner-cta__description">别等建筑落地后才发现布局不顺。先在浏览器中试排 8 种农场，摆放建筑和作物、检查四季与覆盖范围，再照着方案进游戏建造。</p><a href="/zh#planner" data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="lg" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-9 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2" data-blog-planner-cta-action="true">开始规划我的农场<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="inline-end"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><p class="blog-planner-cta__note">免费使用 · 无需注册</p></div><picture class="public-picture" data-public-picture="true"><source srcSet="/homepage/cases/farm-case-01.avif" type="image/avif"/><img alt="包含建筑、作物、道路和池塘的星露谷农场布局" class="blog-planner-cta__image" data-blog-planner-cta-image="true" decoding="async" height="1040" loading="lazy" width="1280" src="/homepage/cases/farm-case-01.webp"/></picture></div></section><section class="blog-sources"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-card py-(--card-spacing) text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl blog-sources__card"><div data-slot="card-header" class="group/card-header @container/card-header grid auto-rows-min items-start gap-1 rounded-t-xl px-(--card-spacing) has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] has-data-[slot=card-description]:grid-rows-[auto_auto] [.border-b]:pb-(--card-spacing) blog-sources__header"><div data-slot="card-title" class="cn-font-heading text-base leading-snug font-medium group-data-[size=sm]/card:text-sm blog-sources__title"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open blog-sources__title-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v16"></path><path d="M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z"></path></svg><h2>来源</h2></div></div><div data-slot="card-content" class="px-(--card-spacing) blog-sources__content"><div role="list" data-slot="item-group" class="group/item-group flex w-full flex-col gap-4 has-data-[size=sm]:gap-2.5 has-data-[size=xs]:gap-2 blog-sources__list"><div class="blog-sources__item-wrapper" role="listitem"><a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Farmhouse" data-slot="item" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="group/item flex w-full flex-wrap items-center rounded-lg border text-sm transition-colors duration-100 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 [a]:transition-colors [a]:hover:bg-muted border-border gap-2.5 px-3 py-2.5 blog-sources__item"><div data-slot="item-media" data-variant="icon" class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 group-has-data-[slot=item-description]/item:translate-y-0.5 group-has-data-[slot=item-description]/item:self-start [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link blog-sources__item-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></div><div data-slot="item-content" class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1 group-data-[size=xs]/item:gap-0 [&amp;+[data-slot=item-content]]:flex-none"><div data-slot="item-title" class="line-clamp-1 flex w-fit items-center gap-2 text-sm leading-snug font-medium underline-offset-4 blog-sources__item-title">农舍</div></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right blog-sources__item-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="blog-sources__item-wrapper" role="listitem"><a href="https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Carpenter%27s_Shop" data-slot="item" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="group/item flex w-full flex-wrap items-center rounded-lg border text-sm transition-colors duration-100 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 [a]:transition-colors [a]:hover:bg-muted border-border gap-2.5 px-3 py-2.5 blog-sources__item"><div data-slot="item-media" data-variant="icon" class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 group-has-data-[slot=item-description]/item:translate-y-0.5 group-has-data-[slot=item-description]/item:self-start [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link blog-sources__item-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></div><div data-slot="item-content" class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1 group-data-[size=xs]/item:gap-0 [&amp;+[data-slot=item-content]]:flex-none"><div data-slot="item-title" class